            "term": "Table columns",
            "definition": "**Code**, **Description**, **Shortname** (for example ST for regular and OT for over time), **VP Code** (required; the code sent to the payroll system), **Data Type**, **Payroll**, **Project**, **Split Header** and **Actions**."
