              "Choose **Ship Material From**.",
              "In **Materials**, enter **Ship Now** for each line (compare it with **Stock** and **Ordered**).",
              "Fill the vehicle and agent fields, sign under **Shipped By (Signature)**.",
              "Click **Submit**."
